      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Thank you.",
      "JA_current": "ありがとう。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_10#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "21",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_21",
      "next": [
        "211",
        "212",
        "213",
        "214"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "2"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "I know many things. Be more specific.",
      "JA_current": "色々と知っている。もっと絞って聞けよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_21#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "31",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_31",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "3"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "I seem to remember he's one of the tough ones. Never actually met the man. Well, I haven't come close to the center in a while and all we get here is rookies. You should find someone who hangs out deep in the Zone and have a chat with him.",
      "JA_current": "タフな男の1人だった気がする。実際に会ったことはないがね。まあ、俺はしばらく中心部に近付いてなかったし、それにここいらはルーキーばかりだからな。ゾーン深くへ頻繁に訪れる連中を見つけ出し、話を聞くといい。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_31#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "41",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_41",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "4"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "I know nothing and that's fine by me, thank you!  Sorry, I know about your situation. Too much mysticism about it. You spend a month in these parts and you can't help but become superstitious about life. Dead people in the trunk, dead people behind the wheel... Who are they, where did they come from and why? I can only hope they didn't rise up from the grave.",
      "JA_current": "何も知らない、知らないことは俺にとっちゃいいことだ、ありがたいことにな！ すまないが、俺はお前に起きたことを知っている。あれに関しちゃあまりに怪しげなことが多すぎる。お前がこの件にひと月を費やすことになったら、生命についての迷信深い人間にならざるを得ないだろうよ。荷台に積まれた死体ども… ヤツらが誰で、どこから来るのか、それは何故なのか？ 俺はヤツらが墓から這い上がってこないことだけを望むよ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_41#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "211",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_211",
      "next": [
        "2111"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "21"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "What's in the center of the Zone?",
      "JA_current": "ゾーンの中心には何があるんだ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_211#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "212",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_212",
      "next": [
        "2121"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "21"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "How did the Zone come to be?",
      "JA_current": "ゾーンは、どうやって出来たんだ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_212#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "213",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_213",
      "next": [
        "2131"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "21"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "What brought you to the Zone?",
      "JA_current": "どうしてゾーンへ行ったんだ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_213#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "214",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_214",
      "next": [
        "2141"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "21"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "What's the most dangerous thing in the Zone?",
      "JA_current": "ゾーンで一番危険なことは何だ？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_214#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "2111",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_2111",
      "next": [
        "21111"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "211"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Ahem, that's a question alright... I've been looking for the answer for two years! I still haven't found a way to the center, at least not one I could take and come back alive. My friends and I tried to break through a couple of times. I barely made it back, but my friends - well, some did, some didn't...  You'll ask why we went there at all. We were chasing our dreams, trying to make them come true.",
      "JA_current": "ふむ、それは確かに疑問だ… 俺は2年ものあいだ答えを探してる！ 中心部への道を俺は未だに見つけていない、たどることが出来て生きて返れる、少なくとも1本の道もな。仲間たちとは何回か突破を試みた。俺はかろうじて戻って来れたが、仲間は ― そう、ある者は戻れ、ある者は戻れず… 一体なぜそこに行ったのかと、聞きたいだろうな。俺たちはそれぞれが夢を追い、それを実現させようとしていたんだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_2111#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "2121",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_2121",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "212"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "There was another explosion here in 2006. That's how it came about. I know that's not a real answer. Very few know the whole truth, if anyone at all.",
      "JA_current": "2006年に、ここで別の爆発があった。それでゾーンが生まれた。それが本当の答えじゃないことは分かっている。誰かが知っているにしても、真実の全容を知る者は、ほとんどいないはずだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_2121#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "2131",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_2131",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "213"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "I used to work in a mine before they closed it down. I had no money and nothing to look forward to. Then I heard some rumors about the fabulous riches hidden inside the Zone. I had some experience under my belt, so I thought \"Why the hell not?\". Can't say I've become rich, but some cash came my way, that's for sure. Not a really interesting story; most of us got here the same way.",
      "JA_current": "俺はある鉱山で働いていた、閉鎖される前の話だが。金も無く、楽しみも無かった。そんな時、ゾーン内部に隠されたすごいお宝の噂をいくつか聞いた。多少の経験は身に着けていたので、「何ッ？」と思ったね。金持ちになったとは言えないだろうが、そこそこの現ナマを手に入れたことは確かだ。典型的な話だよ； 俺たちの多くは似たような理由でそこへ向かったんだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_2131#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "2141",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_2141",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "214"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Hard to say. There are so many dangers and surprises, you just can't run into all of them. There's more than enough for one person anyway. I got one toe bitten off, my hair is falling out from the radiation, and half my leg got fried in a Scorcher... Things are real bad out there. Another time I happened to come face to face with a bloodsucker - now there's a meeting I'd like to forget. So, we can talk all you like, but you'll never truly know until you experience it on your own. The only advice I can give is to be on your guard - everywhere and always.",
      "JA_current": "言葉にはし難いな。すごく多くの危険と驚きがあるよ、そいつら全部に遭遇するわけじゃないがね。1人じゃ全部は無理だ。つま先の1つは噛み切られ、放射線で髪を失った、そして俺の脚の半分は Scorcher の中でフライにされちまった… 最悪の体験だったよ。ある時は Bloodsucker 鉢合わせになった ― 忘れたい出会いだ。まあ、お前が望むすべてを話すこともできるが、これは自分で経験しなきゃ絶対分からんだろう。何処でも何時でも気を付けること ― それが唯一のアドバイスだ。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_2141#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "21111",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_21111",
      "next": [
        "211111"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "2111"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "player",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "Can dreams come true?",
      "JA_current": "夢が叶うのか？",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_21111#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "phrase_id": "211111",
      "text_id": "escape_lager_volk_info_211111",
      "next": [
        "11"
      ],
      "conditions": [],
      "effects": [],
      "other_control": [],
      "incoming": [
        "21111"
      ],
      "speaker_hint": "npc",
      "speaker_hint_basis": "character_binding_and_link_parity",
      "EN": "There is this beautiful story about a Wish-Granting Machine. They say there is a spot in the center of the Zone where any desires can come true, no matter how bizarre. But you know what? I know for a fact there's lots of ways to kick the bucket in the center of the Zone, and I don't believe in the Wish-Granting Machine anymore. Don't take that risk. I wouldn't.",
      "JA_current": "Wish-Granting Machine（願望機）についての美しい話がある。ゾーンの中心には、どんなに突飛でも、どんな望みでも叶う場所が存在すると云われてるんだ。だがまぁ、ゾーンの中心には死に至る多くの厄介事があるってのは本当だよ。それに俺はもう「願望機」の存在を信じていない。そんな危険は冒すなよ。俺はやらないね。",
      "string_entry_candidates": [
        "stable_dialogs_escape:escape_lager_volk_info_211111#1"
      ]
    }
  ]
}